                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>This dashboard contains metrics used by the Dmart Commercial team. Monthly and Weekly Dmart performance is broken down by:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>  1) Fresh vs Non-Fresh category (Fresh = Bread/bakery, Dairy/Chilled/Eggs, Meat/Seafood, Produce, Ready To Consume)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>  2) UltraFresh vs Remaining categories (UltraFresh = Meat/Seafood, Produce, Ready To Consume)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>  3) PIM Category 1 categories</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>  4) PIM Category 2 categories</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>  5) SKU level</run>
