              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Exclude Closed Stores:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Closing stores are excluded starting from the first day of their month of closure. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>As closing stores will start their clearance before the actual closure date and their trends will likely differ from other normal operating stores.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Other Definitions:</run>
              </formatted-text>
